{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "193858ad-223d-4085-b163-bca5126fad25",
    "name": "Bifrost HTTP Transport MCP Management API",
    "description": "A unified HTTP API for accessing multiple AI model providers:\n\n\u2022 openai\n\u2022 anthropic\n\u2022 azure\n\u2022 bedrock\n\u2022 cohere\n\u2022 vertex\n\u2022 mistral\n\u2022 ollama\n\u2022 groq\n\u2022 sgl\n\nBifrost provides:\n\n**Core Features:**\n\u2022 Standardized **OpenAI Compatible** endpoints for text and chat completions\n\u2022 Built-in fallback support across providers\n\u2022 Comprehensive monitoring and logging\n\u2022 Real-time WebSocket streaming\n\n**Audio Processing:**\n\u2022 Speech synthesis (text-to-speech) with multiple voices and formats\n\u2022 Audio transcription (speech-to-text) with timing information\n\u2022 Streaming support for both speech and transcription\n\u2022 OpenAI-compatible audio endpoints\n\n**MCP Integration:**\n\u2022 Model Context Protocol (MCP) support for external tool integration\n\u2022 Dynamic MCP client management (add/remove/edit clients)\n\u2022 STDIO, HTTP, and SSE connection types\n\u2022 Automatic tool discovery and execution\n\n**Management APIs:**\n\u2022 Provider configuration management (CRUD operations)\n\u2022 System configuration hot-reloading\n\u2022 Application logs with advanced filtering\n\u2022 Dropped request monitoring\n\n**Integration Endpoints:**\n\u2022 OpenAI-compatible: `/openai/chat/completions`, `/openai/audio/speech`, `/openai/audio/transcriptions`\n\u2022 Anthropic-compatible: `/anthropic/v1/messages`\n\u2022 Google Gemini-compatible: `/genai/v1beta/models/{model}`\n\u2022 LiteLLM-compatible: `/chat/completions`\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Bifrost API Support",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "createdAt": "2026-10-22T01:05:48.000Z",
    "updatedAt": "2026-10-22T01:05:48.000Z",
